#: pe/ui/settings.cpp
msgid "Choose PlayStation or Switch button positions. The selected mapping stays fixed during menus and gameplay; customizing a button creates a custom profile."
msgstr "Choose PlayStation or Switch button positions. The selected mapping stays fixed during menus and gameplay; customizing a button creates a custom profile."

#: pe/ui/settings.cpp
msgid "The deadzone ignores small stick movements near the center. At 8%, movements below 8% do not steer the game. Increase it if your character moves by itself; lower it if aiming feels unresponsive."
msgstr "The deadzone ignores small stick movements near the center. At 8%, movements below 8% do not steer the game. Increase it if your character moves by itself; lower it if aiming feels unresponsive."

#: pe/ui/settings.cpp
msgid "Choose the Encore or Switch launcher theme; gameplay rendering does not change."
msgstr "Choose the Encore or Switch launcher theme; gameplay rendering does not change."

#: pe/ui/settings.cpp
msgid "Choose the logo treatment independently of the selected interface palette."
msgstr "Choose the logo treatment independently of the selected interface palette."

#: pe/ui/settings.cpp
msgid "Change the color of selection highlights and focus rings."
msgstr "Change the color of selection highlights and focus rings."

#: pe/ui/settings.cpp
msgid "Choose a theme background, two custom colors, a local image or the daily game artwork."
msgstr "Choose a theme background, two custom colors, a local image or the daily game artwork."

#: pe/ui/settings.cpp
msgid "App wallpapers: /data/prosperoeden/user/wallpapers. These appear first; PS5 captures (JPG/PNG/JXR) follow. HDR JXR converts to WebP only when chosen."
msgstr "앱 배경화면: /data/prosperoeden/user/wallpapers. 이 이미지가 먼저 표시되고 PS5 스크린샷(JPG/PNG/JXR)이 뒤따릅니다. HDR JXR은 선택한 경우에만 WebP로 변환합니다."

